  "description": "Test build of Poppy as in League (needs League of Legends Heroes): replaces the main pack's Poppy so Steadfast Presence knocks up and grounds the enemies caught dashing in her aura (the main pack: no new dashes inside it) and doubles its armour and magic resist under 40% health, Heroic Charge stuns only when it carries the target into a wall (the main pack: a short stun after every carry), Keeper's Verdict sends the champions it hits flying toward their own fountain (the main pack: knocked away from her), and Iron Ambassador's shield grows with her max health. Other champions are untouched. Writes a log for testing.",
